# YamVim

My personal Neovim configuration based on

## Structure

```
├── init.lua
└── lua/isai/
    ├── core/
    │   ├── keymaps.lua
    │   └── options.lua
    ├── lazy.lua
    └── plugins/
        ├── alpha.lua
        ├── autopairs.lua
        ├── bufferline.lua
        ├── colorscheme.lua
        ├── lint.lua
        ├── lspconfig.lua
        ├── lualine.lua
        ├── mason.lua
        ├── nvim-tree.lua
        ├── telescope.lua
        └── yazi.lua
```

## Plugins

| Plugin | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| [lazy.nvim](https://github.com/folke/lazy.nvim) | Plugin manager |
| [Catppuccin](https://github.com/catppuccin/nvim) | Colorscheme (Mocha, transparent) |
| [nvim-tree](https://github.com/nvim-tree/nvim-tree.lua) | File explorer |
| [bufferline](https://github.com/akinsho/bufferline.nvim) | Buffer tabs |
| [lualine](https://github.com/nvim-lualine/lualine.nvim) | Statusline |
| [telescope](https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim) | Fuzzy finder |
| [mason](https://github.com/williamboman/mason.nvim) | LSP/linter installer |
| [nvim-lspconfig](https://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig) | LSP configuration |
| [nvim-lint](https://github.com/mfussenegger/nvim-lint) | Linting |
| [autopairs](https://github.com/windwp/nvim-autopairs) | Auto bracket/quote pairs |
| [alpha](https://github.com/goolord/alpha-nvim) | Dashboard |
| [yazi](https://github.com/mikavilpas/yazi.nvim) | File manager integration |

## Key Mappings

Leader key: `Space`

### General
| Mapping | Action |
|---------|--------|
| `<leader>nh` | Clear search highlights |
| `<leader>+` | Increment number |
| `<leader>-` | Decrement number |

### Windows
| Mapping | Action |
|---------|--------|
| `Ctrl+h/l/j/k` | Navigate windows |
| `Ctrl+Arrow` | Resize windows |

### Buffers
| Mapping | Action |
|---------|--------|
| `Tab` | Next buffer |
| `Shift+Tab` | Previous buffer |
| `<leader>x` | Close buffer |

### Other
| Mapping | Action |
|---------|--------|
| `<leader>e` | Toggle file explorer |
| `<leader>t` | Open terminal |

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/exgolden/YamVim.git ~/.config/nvim
nvim
```

Lazy.nvim will bootstrap itself and install all plugins on first launch.

